# Shell scripts must stay LF: bash on the Linux CI runner (and macOS) chokes
# on CRLF ("syntax error near unexpected token $'\r'"). Git for Windows with
# core.autocrlf=true otherwise checks them out as CRLF, which only breaks the
# release workflow (release.yml runs `bash scripts/patch-appimage.sh`) and
# local `bash -n` verification on Windows.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf